{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944760/extras/9490e8b0ef04ca62ebd0ec0838672061.avif?t=1751955507\" width=550 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maze solving puzzle game of high contrast colors and moving obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Demo also available below!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944760/extras/3ed8921d124ea71855f62d0668e4fe08.webp?t=1751955507\" width=219 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world made of labyrinths and colorful obstacles, move a glowing cube through beautiful worlds of color to find the ending star. Discover each colorful world, unlocking auras and hidden areas, all ending with an epic test of skill in Rainbow World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944760/extras/8f370c5a091d971e03ef81801740976e.webp?t=1751955507\" width=551 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944760/extras/588b36776eed47cab5223c6ea7ce00c0.webp?t=1751955507\" width=219 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 No time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 No added quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Simple move controls. (keyboard, mouse or game controller)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \u200bIntegrated menu system with minimal UI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Original music by Matt Reeves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944760/extras/84f14d06a6c50ea56d0bbc044dd00e86.avif?t=1751955507\" width=554 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944760/extras/d5d7cda94545d10f46a69a15e9910fb3.webp?t=1751955507\" width=219 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Move thru labyrinths from 7 worlds of color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Discover all hidden areas and glowing stars to complete 100%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Use quick reaction time and patience to slide through each section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Collect a protective color aura to help against obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Discover 100% on all levels of a world and unlock the permanent aura.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Solve mazes in a high contrast, colorful world, while listening to an all original 8 song soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944760/extras/19fa420cd84d6f5e3bd324a51f42a1d9.webp?t=1751955507\" width=551 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944760/extras/5a245c64d24fbe8f59c6d85b0981d7d7.webp?t=1751955507\" width=219 height=44 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944760/extras/ec4d3bb3397d2c64f8ec0090a02259f1.avif?t=1751955507\" width=568 height=218 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1944760?t=1751955507","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse